[
  {
    "id": "fins_udp_dm_read",
    "proto": "fins",
    "summary": "T-001: FINS/UDP 内存区读-响应往返（DM D100 读 2 字），请求 ICF=0x81/响应 ICF=0xC1，SID=0x01 回显，10.0.0.1:1234<->20.0.0.1:9600",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "udp": {}
        },
        {
          "fins": {}
        }
      ],
      "src_ip": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst_ip": "20.0.0.1",
      "src_port": 1234,
      "dst_port": 9600,
      "fins": {
        "transport": "udp",
        "commands": [
          {
            "command": 257,
            "memory_area": "dm",
            "address": 100,
            "items": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 2,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.icf",
          "value": "0x81"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.sid",
          "value": "0x01"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.command",
          "value": "0x0101"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.memory.area.read",
          "value": "0x82"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.memory.address",
          "value": "0x0064"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.memory.numitems",
          "value": "2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "udp.dstport",
          "value": "9600"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "omron.icf",
          "value": "0xc1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "omron.sid",
          "value": "0x01"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "omron.response.code",
          "value": "0x0000"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "udp.srcport",
          "value": "9600"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "udp.dstport",
          "value": "1234"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "19-fins-design.md §3.4/§6 S1：请求 FINS 帧=10头+2命令码+6参数(UDP offset 42 起)",
        "omron.response.data 为非空 bytes 存在性断言(2 字) 可用 nonzero",
        "高位大端：area=0x82、address=0x0064"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "fins_tcp_read",
    "proto": "fins",
    "summary": "T-002: FINS/TCP Frame Send 读取（D100 读 2 字），FINS/TCP 头 'FINS' magic+length=26+command=0x00000002+error=0，TCP 9600，带握手；omron.tcp.command 与 omron.command 隔离验证",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "tcp": {}
        },
        {
          "fins": {}
        }
      ],
      "src_ip": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst_ip": "20.0.0.1",
      "src_port": 1235,
      "dst_port": 9600,
      "fins": {
        "transport": "tcp",
        "commands": [
          {
            "command": 257,
            "memory_area": "dm",
            "address": 100,
            "items": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "negotiated": true,
      "min_packets": 7,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "omron.tcp.magic",
          "value": "0x46494e53"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "omron.tcp.length",
          "value": "26"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "omron.tcp.command",
          "value": "0x00000002"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "omron.tcp.error_code",
          "value": "0x00000000"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "omron.icf",
          "value": "0x81"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "omron.command",
          "value": "0x0101"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "field": "omron.tcp.length",
          "value": "26"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "field": "omron.icf",
          "value": "0xc1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "field": "omron.response.code",
          "value": "0x0000"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "19-fins-design.md §2.7：FINS/TCP 头=magic(4)+length(4)+command(4)+error(4)，共 16B；length=26 为完整 FINS/TCP 负载长度（command+error+FINS frame），不含前 8B",
        "packet 4=首个数据段（请求），packet 5=响应；TCP 握手占 1-3",
        "omron.tcp.command=0x00000002 (Frame Send) ≠ omron.command=0x0101"
      ]
    }
  },
