  {
    "id": "fins_clock_read_bcd",
    "proto": "fins",
    "summary": "T-012: Clock Read（0x0701）无参数请求 + BCD 响应（世纪20/年26/月08/日18/时14/分30/秒00/星期02）；Wireshark 对 0x0701 响应不解析结束码，用 FrameAssert 校验",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "udp": {}
        },
        {
          "fins": {}
        }
      ],
      "src_ip": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst_ip": "20.0.0.1",
      "src_port": 1244,
      "dst_port": 9600,
      "fins": {
        "transport": "udp",
        "commands": [
          {
            "command": 1793,
            "clock": {
              "century": 20,
              "year": 26,
              "month": 8,
              "day": 18,
              "hour": 14,
              "minute": 30,
              "second": 0,
              "weekday": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 2,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.command",
          "value": "0x0701"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "omron.sid",
          "value": "0x01"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "omron.icf",
          "value": "0xc1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "omron.command",
          "value": "0x0701"
        }
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "00 00 26 08 18 14 30 00 02"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Wireshark omron-fins dissector 0x0701 response = 10头+2命令码+2结束码+7 BCD(年/月/日/时/分/秒/星期)=21 字节，无世纪字段(century只进配置不上线)",
        "Wireshark 0x0701 分支不解析结束码（packet-omron-fins.c），故响应断言全用 FrameAssert",
        "BCD 小时=0x14（BCD SID 强制覆盖点，SID 本身为普通字节 0x01）",
        "请求帧=10+2=12 字节；FrameAssert 校验请求无参数（12 字节后无内容）"
      ]
    }
  },
